OL,3,ADWP confirms cyber attack forced it to
OL,4,Atake pension and benefits systems
OL,5,Aoffline
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Department for Work and Pensions
OL,8,Fconfirms a cyber attack forced it to
OL,9,Ftake some of its services offline -
OL,10,Fhere's what we still don't know
OL,12,FWork and Pensions Secretary Pat
OL,13,FMcFadden says "it's right" that the
OL,14,Fgovernment took its time to establish
OL,15,Fthat the incident was a cyber attack
OL,17,FHe says that services will be restored
OL,18,F"as soon as possible", but could not
OL,19,Fsay exactly when that may be
