OL,3,ADWP confirms cyber attack forced it to
OL,4,Atake pension and benefits systems
OL,5,Aoffline
OL,6,
OL,7,FPip, pension and universal credit
OL,8,Fsystems are still down - we look at how
OL,9,Fthe incident unfolded
OL,11,FThe government says that as of now
OL,12,Fthere is no evidence that personal
OL,13,Finformation has been compromised
OL,15,FIn a statement, it says there was "an
OL,16,Fattempt to gain unauthorised access to
OL,17,Four systems" - and it warns people to
OL,18,Fremain vigilant to scams
